'''Vs Baki Hanma''' (VS範馬刃牙, ''VS Hanma Baki'', '''VS Baki Hanma''') is a [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event|Hanma Baki: Son of Ogre]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 14.3 Update]]. The boss of this [[Gauntlet]] is [[Baki Hanma (Enemy)|Baki Hanma]].

==Overview==
===About===
Vs Baki Hanma contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''The Strongest Student Lvs'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a The Strongest Student Lv. can include XP, [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]] and Legend Dumbbells. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Vs Baki Hanma/The Strongest Student Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Vs Baki Hanma is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

